I got this message in normal play.  I was in the Valley of the Dead, and
managed to hit Alt-P instead of Ctl-P (which, on my DOS box, meant that
I prayed instead of looked at the previous message).  Since I had
previously offed whole slews of Moloch's priests, as well as the grand
high enchilada to get the Amulet, Moloch was NOT happy with Elvis the
Barbarian.  In a feeble attempt to kill me, he zapped a lightening bolt
at me (the "holy wrath" bit).  It bounced off my shield of reflection. 
So, he sent the "wide beam death ray", and since I was magic proof
(GDSM, doncha know?), I just basked in the glow.  He gave up.  It isn't
often you get to defy the gods like this.  I was happy.

